{"product_id":"the-presence-of-angels","title":"The Presence of Angels","description":"\u003cp\u003eSally and Henry are both outsiders to Kuala Lumpur, a melting pot of cultures and traditions. Each, unexpectedly, finds love. And while their paths never cross, they become inextricably tangled in the city's web. This is a story of the fragility of love, the surprise gift of life and the power of destiny.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 0 x 200\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Margaret Barbalet\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780140299175\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 291\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45834252845209,"sku":"17RD-29780140299175","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ff41537b4ef_The_Presence_of_Angels_Margaret_Barbalet.jpg?v=1761582669","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-presence-of-angels","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}